-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC # Object and Metadata Migration
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC This lesson will introduce practical strategies for object and metadata migration, highlighting how HMS federation enables a seamless, incremental transition by mirroring your existing Hive assets in Unity Catalog, as well as showcasing manual and automated table migration methods—such as SYNC commands and the comprehensive UCX toolkit. By exploring these approaches, participants will learn how to maintain uninterrupted workflows, benefit from UC security and lineage features, and minimize coordination overhead during the migration process.
