-- MAGIC </div>
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC - **Workspace Boundaries:** joins involving data stored in the legacy Hive Metastore only work within the workspace where that metastore resides. There are no such workspace boundaries in a Unity Catalog metastore.
-- MAGIC - **Compatibility:** You cannot create views in Unity Catalog that reference both UC and HMS objects. You must ensure that all table references inside your view definition reference only objects in UC. 
-- MAGIC - **Dynamic views:** dynamic views work in UC, but consider switching to a more modern approach for fine-grained access control, such as [Attributed Based Access Control](https://docs.databricks.com/aws/en/data-governance/unity-catalog/abac/) (ABAC) or [per-table row filtering/column masking](https://docs.databricks.com/aws/en/data-governance/unity-catalog/filters-and-masks).
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC

